note OM-1 TWIN of ce-sized.om (unroll removed, om2 line made a note) for the pinned compiler 734f0a39.
note Contract section 4 lines 105-106: an index into a SIZED array that is a constant after unrolling
note or folding is checked at compile time; inside the array it is accepted (no error 21) and runs.
note a = 1 11 21 31 written with put a i, read back with get a i and the folded get a sub 3 i.
note Twin ce-sized-rolled.om has the same stdout: oracle/s3s4/exp/ce-sized.out (python3).
note OM-1 unit: this line replaces the om2 line
fn main to int
a = new ulong 4 0
for i ulong 4
put a i add mul i 10 1
end
s = ulong 0
for i ulong 4
s = add mul s 100 get a i
end
pu s
t = ulong 0
for i ulong 4
t = add mul t 100 get a sub 3 i
end
pu t
ret 0
end
